  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">更好的任务栏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/358878159615164416/966919116151734312/logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"882\" height=\"294\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这个模组让任务栏变得更好，例如在加载资源和加载世界时在任务栏上添加进度。</p><p>它不适用于除Windows 64位以外的操作系统。</p><p>如果在不受支持的操作系统上安装，它不会导致任何崩溃等问题，但这个模组将不会做任何事情。</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/358878159615164416/900506746982907924/d0987df6d1195653647002c12c59cf5b.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"330\"></p><p>Windows10</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/358878159615164416/900506761860091954/c0bce3c60b43ecf6fa8081cb441f411e.gif\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Windows11</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/358878159615164416/900507099849711636/f3d98ca62de79d9c8f5b2d66d925eccd.gif\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组包</span></p><p>请随意使用。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X9BUF9A\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p>",
